      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The world *is* vast, and it's easy to feel insignificant when you look at something so huge. But your smallness is also your freedom; you have the power to decide how much of this noise you want to carry. If you're feeling like disappearing, that's a very real, very powerful urge, and it's a sign that the pain is overwhelming. Reaching out to someone, even just to talk about how small you feel, is the first step toward making your presence matter again.",
      "source": "target",
