    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really noise to me though. it's more like... nothingness. it feels more peaceful thinking about how little of an impact i actually make. if i'm gone, the silence stays the same. there's a weird kind of comfort in knowing it wouldn't cause a ripple. like, there's no mess to clean up. it's just easy.",
